      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate experienced a gross prior year reserve strengthening of GBP 77.144 million in 2023, calculated from the gross claims development triangle. This translates to a 6.088% strengthening relative to the opening gross claims outstanding. The net prior year development, after the protection provided by the Loss Portfolio Transfer (LPT), was a strengthening of GBP 7.637 million. Causes for reserve movements include the impact of higher economic and social inflation on loss costs, challenges from the economic environment, international conflicts such as the Russia and Ukraine conflict and the Israel and Gaza conflict, and financial market volatility. The LPT, effective from 2021 and covering 2019 and prior accident years, had a favourable impact of GBP 9.3 million on the prior year underwriting loss, mitigating some of the adverse development.",
